<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Hold Undead</h1>
<p>Sphere: Mind Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Necromancer (guild level 14), Healer (guild level 23)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast hold undead &lt;target&gt;
</pre>
<p>Holds an undead creature in place: for five rounds it can't fight, and it 
can't flee. It has no effect on the living. The spell is very difficult to 
use and may therefore fail quite often: it needs a good cast to work at all. 
Casting it starts a fight with the target, whether it works or not.
</p><p>It is also found on wands, scrolls and potions.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
